<Base title="The Club" description="About Chingkhei Hunba Polo Club, Kongpal, Imphal East.">
  <PageHeader title="The Club" lede="A polo and equestrian club from Kongpal, Imphal East, playing in Manipur’s state tournaments since 1995." />

  <h2>Who we are</h2>
  <p>
    Chingkhei Hunba Polo Club (CHPC) became an affiliated club of the Manipur Horse Riding &amp; Polo Association
    on 15 August 1995, and has played in the state’s polo tournaments ever since. It is a registered society,
    based at Kongpal Kshetri Leikai, Imphal East, and plays in the calendars of the Manipur Horse Riding &amp; Polo
    Association (MHRPA) and the All Manipur Polo Association (AMPA).
  </p>
  <p>
    The club has fielded three men’s sides (A, B and C) in the same tournament, as well as a women’s side, and
    also competes in equestrian events: show jumping, tent pegging and arambai throwing.
  </p>
