  <h2>Polo in Manipur</h2>
  <p>
    Polo is played in Manipur as Sagol Kangjei, on the Manipuri pony. Clubs are rooted in their neighbourhoods,
    and players commonly keep their own ponies. State finals are played at Mapal Kangjeibung in Imphal, widely
    described as the oldest polo ground still in use.
  </p>

  <h2>Office bearers</h2>
  <p>In 2018 the club had seven executive members, with Th. Thoinu Devi as President. She was still named President in 2024.</p>
